### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Compare caller-side P95 duration with traces for inference, retries and tool execution. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
Slow inference, network delay, retries or tool/dependency latency.

### Fix
Address the slow trace segment and align request limits with the caller latency budget.

### Verify
Caller-side P95 duration falls below the threshold during comparable traffic. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
